 "instruments_this_issue": [
  "weather_permeability_control.py (EXTENDED): membership-held-fixed decomposition + per-cohort identity assertion + author-level per-cohort trend test with a permutation null - issue #5 watch item #3 asked for a fixed-cohort view",
  "weather_gpu.py (EXTENDED): allocation label-coverage audit; counts classifier retries, reports per-day label coverage, and diffs the emitted daily series against the previous published issue so retro-movement is attributable rather than discovered by hand",
  "weather_dip_rate.py (NEW): sub-forth dip rate computed per issue over the windows each issue added, replacing the pooled share issue #4 quoted; asserts that the shared prefix of consecutive rolling series is bit-identical, which is what makes the decomposition valid",
  "weather_label_move.py (NEW): attributes a retro-moved allocation day to an integer count of items and their labels, so the label audit reports WHY a settled cell moved, not just THAT it did; reports AMBIGUOUS rather than guessing when more than one (venue, labelled) pair fits"
 ],
